# The GPT experiment's working directory. It is parked on the `gpt-experiment`
# branch, where `gpt/` is tracked — an ignore rule does not untrack anything, so
# this only stops training runs and checkpoints showing up as untracked noise on
# `main`. `tools/deploy.json` excludes `gpt` on both branches.
